Monitoring

`Prometheus` scrapes `API`, `Worker` and `Database`, with the label `scrape`.
`Grafana` reads `Prometheus`, with the label `read`. `Prometheus` sends to
`Alertmanager` with the label `alerts`, and `Alertmanager` calls the
`On-call engineer` with the label `page`.
---
Prometheus -> API, Worker, Database: scrape
Grafana -> Prometheus: read
Prometheus -> Alertmanager: alerts
Alertmanager -> On-call engineer: page
